TITLE:: ActionQSubMenu
SUMMARY:: A Button with a popup Menu for performing actions.
CATEGORIES:: GUI>Views, Libraries>jostMlib
related:: jostMlib,  Classes/ActionQMenu,Classes/Menu, Classes/MenuAction

DESCRIPTION::
A Submenu for ActionQMenu.

See  link::Classes/ActionQMenu::.


CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Create an ActionQSubMenu

ARGUMENT:: name
The submenu  Title

ARGUMENT:: items
An Array of link::Classes/String::, link::Classes/Association:: (\key->function), link::Classes/MenuAction::, or link::Classes/ActionQSubMenu::.


MenuAction will give you the most customizability.

returns::
an ActionMenu


INSTANCEMETHODS::


PRIVATE:: prMakeMenu
EXAMPLES::

code::
(
w = Window.new("ActionMenu Examples").front;
// action arguments are |val,modifier,buttonNum|
w.flow{arg w;
	var r=ActionQMenu(w,120@30,"testmenu",[
		"-divider example",
		'Test1'->{"-> Test1".postln},
		"-test2",
		MenuAction("Test2").action_({|a|"-> ".post; a.postln}),
		MenuAction("Test3"),
		"Test4",
		"-",
		ActionQSubMenu("Submenu1",[
			'Submenu1.test1'->{"-> Submenu1.test1".postln},
			MenuAction("Submenu1.test2"),
			"Submenu1.test3",
			ActionQSubMenu("SubSubmenu",[
				'Submenu2.test1'->{"-> SubSubmenu.test1".postln},
				MenuAction("SubSubmenu.test2"),
				"SubSubmenu.test3"
			])

		])

	],{"-> default action".postln},{"-> global action".postln;"".postln});
	// if you want defaultAction and globalAction to propogate to submenus,
	// they must be in the top menu constructor.

};
)

::
